### Create coupon

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{couponCode}}",
  "maxUsageCount": 100,
  "countryCode": "PL"
}

### Redeem coupon

POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/coupons/redeem
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "{{couponCode}}",
  "userId": "user-123"
}
